{"title": "Daiana Blake", "pageid": 2098, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Daiana Blake </b>is <a href=\"/wiki/Avel\" title=\"Avel\">Avel's</a> mistress and daughter to Baron Bayle, Yander's vinter. For a time she is possessed by the <a href=\"/wiki/Ty%27iga\" title=\"Ty&#39;iga\"><i>ty'iga</i></a> spirit which <a href=\"/wiki/O'Briain\" title=\"O'Briain\"><b>O'Briain</b></a> has set to watch over <a href=\"/wiki/Moorlin\" title=\"Moorlin\">Moorlin</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofyander.fandom.com/wiki/Vinta_Bayle?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260429120313\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 336/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.251      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.251      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofyander:pcache:idhash:2098-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260429120313 and revision id 4310. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Avel", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "O'Briain", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Moorlin", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "ti